sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor DEV as PR author
    participant GH as GitHub Actions
    participant RES as archetypectl
    participant TM as terramate
    participant GKE as GKE qa · DNS endpoint (IAM only)

    DEV->>GH: PR (e.g. new image_digest)
    GH->>RES: resolve --dry-run
    RES-->>GH: binding.tm.hcl + claims
    GH->>TM: generate --check (G0) · conftest (G1) · checkov (G2)
    GH->>TM: script run tofu preview · sharing ON · mocks ON
    TM->>GKE: plan (helm, kubernetes)
    GH->>GH: G3 over plan.json · PR comment
    DEV->>GH: approval + merge
    Note over GH: GitHub Environment qa · required reviewers
    GH->>TM: script run tofu deploy · sharing ON · mocks OFF
    TM->>GKE: apply in after order
    GH->>GH: CMDB sync
